## 1. PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Implement a clean separation of responsibilities across the three operational portals:

1. Lodge Management Portal — Tenant Business Management.
2. Platform Management Portal — ENKAI Global Platform Administration.
3. CCTV Edge Agent Portal — Local CCTV Infrastructure, Processing and Operations.

The most important architectural requirement is:

**Receptionists, cashiers, housekeeping staff and ordinary lodge employees must NOT have access to CCTV intelligence, CCTV evidence, revenue investigations or AI video analysis.**

CCTV intelligence results must be delivered to authorized tenant management users through the central cloud backend, with strict tenant and branch filtering.

All CCTV camera configuration, local video processing, door-zone configuration, evidence generation, local buffering and synchronization operations belong to the CCTV Edge Agent.

The Platform Management Portal must provide ENKAI Super Administrators with comprehensive management capabilities across the entire SaaS platform.

This phase is primarily a navigation, portal allocation, permissions and access-control refactoring task. Preserve existing business logic and working integrations.

