## 6.3 Edge/Cloud AI Responsibility

Maintain the actual hybrid architecture.

CCTV Edge Agent:

- RTSP/ONVIF camera connection.
- Local frame acquisition.
- Person detection/tracking.
- Door-zone interaction detection.
- Local entry/exit event generation.
- Evidence clip creation.
- Local buffering and synchronization.

Central Cloud:

- Event validation.
- Evidence processing.
- Gemini multimodal video analysis.
- Structured analysis persistence.
- PMS reconciliation.
- Tenant management notifications.

Do not label Gemini cloud processing as local edge processing unless a real local model implementation exists.

Do not send continuous full video streams to Gemini.

Use event-triggered clips and controlled upload policies.

The Agent must retain local event data safely during network interruptions and synchronize using idempotent event identifiers.

